{"logId": "ed2e2d06-cdfe-4cd9-a88a-66556cb605b1", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 2800, "height": 2000, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "text", "block_content": "大家庭中分享快乐和幸福，否则也不是合格的胖东来员工，更不会是心灵美丽和幸福的人，我想大家也绝不允许这样的员工来为胖东来品牌抹黑，如果哪位员工做不到必须离开这个岗位，离开胖东来，顾客是不会给你机会的。各层主管人员切实履行自己的岗位职责，关心引导并严格要求下属，不要违背公司制度，一旦有人不执行服务制度，让顾客失望，必须严格按制度标准处理，否则上级普查住负连带责任，接受公司处罚，望各级主管严格执行，并要求员工不要触犯，这也是为更多的人将来着想，希望大家理解，更相信你们都能发自内心做到，这也是对自己负责。让自己更好更健康地成长。", "block_bbox": [127, 141, 2621, 513], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[127.0, 141.0], [2621.0, 141.0], [2621.0, 513.0], [127.0, 513.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "我身上有太多的不足，我会不断修正自己，无论谁带领胖东来这个团队，只要按照公司的信仰和理念朝着大家所梦想的：公平、自由、快乐、博爱的方向发展，我们都会分享不断探索、追求和实现有意义的过程。", "block_bbox": [128, 541, 2600, 673], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[128.0, 541.0], [2600.0, 541.0], [2600.0, 673.0], [128.0, 673.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "我的内心有很多东西需要提升和整理，我会和大家一起不断的学习了解宇宙的形成变化和自然规律的变化，了解生命进化的规律，了解世界各种宗教信仰的发展过程，了解东西方文化的差异，了解西方哲学思想和东方儒家思想，了解人类进化过程当中的重要事件，了解更多更多的东西……然后吸取精华，弃之糟粕（不好的东西）使我们的目标更清晰、更快乐、更明确。希望胖东来为大家带来的不只是物质改变，更是精神的充实和提升。不断修正自己的缺点，结果会越来越好！", "block_bbox": [129, 700, 2632, 992], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[129.0, 700.0], [2632.0, 700.0], [2632.0, 992.0], [129.0, 992.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "送你们几句：愚昧的人总是悲观，因为人的生命太短暂", "block_bbox": [205, 1020, 1195, 1069], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[205.0, 1020.0], [1195.0, 1020.0], [1195.0, 1069.0], [205.0, 1069.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "乐观才是真正的智慧，原来生命的过程是这么有意义", "block_bbox": [451, 1101, 1396, 1148], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[451.0, 1101.0], [1396.0, 1101.0], [1396.0, 1148.0], [451.0, 1148.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "我更会用乐观的态度不断改变自身的愚昧。", "block_bbox": [451, 1181, 1211, 1228], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[451.0, 1181.0], [1211.0, 1181.0], [1211.0, 1228.0], [451.0, 1228.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "心态决定着幸福，好的心态一生都会幸福。", "block_bbox": [454, 1260, 1211, 1307], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[454.0, 1260.0], [1211.0, 1260.0], [1211.0, 1307.0], [454.0, 1307.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "对于好的、能使自己开心和快乐的东西，不要只学会看和聆听，学会去做才会实现你所想要的结果。", "block_bbox": [450, 1340, 2224, 1387], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[450.0, 1340.0], [2224.0, 1340.0], [2224.0, 1387.0], [450.0, 1387.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "相信自己，相信身边的人，相信只要努力梦想就能实现！", "block_bbox": [450, 1419, 1457, 1468], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[450.0, 1419.0], [1457.0, 1419.0], [1457.0, 1468.0], [450.0, 1468.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "于东来", "block_bbox": [2216, 1639, 2347, 1683], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[2216.0, 1639.0], [2347.0, 1639.0], [2347.0, 1683.0], [2216.0, 1683.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2009年5月3日", "block_bbox": [2154, 1704, 2400, 1746], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[2154.0, 1704.0], [2400.0, 1704.0], [2400.0, 1746.0], [2154.0, 1746.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "17", "block_bbox": [2646, 1913, 2695, 1943], "block_id": 11, "block_order": null, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[2646.0, 1913.0], [2694.0, 1913.0], [2694.0, 1942.0], [2646.0, 1942.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9600412249565125, "coordinate": [127, 141, 2621, 513], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[127.0, 141.0], [2621.0, 141.0], [2621.0, 513.0], [127.0, 513.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.927665650844574, "coordinate": [128, 541, 2600, 673], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[128.0, 541.0], [2600.0, 541.0], [2600.0, 673.0], [128.0, 673.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.953617513179779, "coordinate": [129, 700, 2632, 992], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[129.0, 700.0], [2632.0, 700.0], [2632.0, 992.0], [129.0, 992.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8593138456344604, "coordinate": [205, 1020, 1195, 1069], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[205.0, 1020.0], [1195.0, 1020.0], [1195.0, 1069.0], [205.0, 1069.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.849095344543457, "coordinate": [451, 1101, 1396, 1148], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[451.0, 1101.0], [1396.0, 1101.0], [1396.0, 1148.0], [451.0, 1148.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8487277626991272, "coordinate": [451, 1181, 1211, 1228], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[451.0, 1181.0], [1211.0, 1181.0], [1211.0, 1228.0], [451.0, 1228.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8688474297523499, "coordinate": [454, 1260, 1211, 1307], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[454.0, 1260.0], [1211.0, 1260.0], [1211.0, 1307.0], [454.0, 1307.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8848305940628052, "coordinate": [450, 1340, 2224, 1387], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[450.0, 1340.0], [2224.0, 1340.0], [2224.0, 1387.0], [450.0, 1387.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8690087199211121, "coordinate": [450, 1419, 1457, 1468], "order": 9, "polygon_points": [[450.0, 1419.0], [1457.0, 1419.0], [1457.0, 1468.0], [450.0, 1468.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.764746367931366, "coordinate": [2216, 1639, 2347, 1683], "order": 10, "polygon_points": [[2216.0, 1639.0], [2347.0, 1639.0], [2347.0, 1683.0], [2216.0, 1683.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7799535393714905, "coordinate": [2154, 1704, 2400, 1746], "order": 11, "polygon_points": [[2154.0, 1704.0], [2400.0, 1704.0], [2400.0, 1746.0], [2154.0, 1746.0]]}, {"cls_id": 16, "label": "number", "score": 0.6656225323677063, "coordinate": [2646, 1913, 2695, 1943], "order": 12, "polygon_points": [[2646.0, 1913.0], [2694.0, 1913.0], [2694.0, 1942.0], [2646.0, 1942.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "大家庭中分享快乐和幸福，否则也不是合格的胖东来员工，更不会是心灵美丽和幸福的人，我想大家也绝不允许这样的员工来为胖东来品牌抹黑，如果哪位员工做不到必须离开这个岗位，离开胖东来，顾客是不会给你机会的。各层主管人员切实履行自己的岗位职责，关心引导并严格要求下属，不要违背公司制度，一旦有人不执行服务制度，让顾客失望，必须严格按制度标准处理，否则上级普查住负连带责任，接受公司处罚，望各级主管严格执行，并要求员工不要触犯，这也是为更多的人将来着想，希望大家理解，更相信你们都能发自内心做到，这也是对自己负责。让自己更好更健康地成长。\n\n我身上有太多的不足，我会不断修正自己，无论谁带领胖东来这个团队，只要按照公司的信仰和理念朝着大家所梦想的：公平、自由、快乐、博爱的方向发展，我们都会分享不断探索、追求和实现有意义的过程。\n\n我的内心有很多东西需要提升和整理，我会和大家一起不断的学习了解宇宙的形成变化和自然规律的变化，了解生命进化的规律，了解世界各种宗教信仰的发展过程，了解东西方文化的差异，了解西方哲学思想和东方儒家思想，了解人类进化过程当中的重要事件，了解更多更多的东西……然后吸取精华，弃之糟粕（不好的东西）使我们的目标更清晰、更快乐、更明确。希望胖东来为大家带来的不只是物质改变，更是精神的充实和提升。不断修正自己的缺点，结果会越来越好！\n\n送你们几句：愚昧的人总是悲观，因为人的生命太短暂\n\n乐观才是真正的智慧，原来生命的过程是这么有意义\n\n我更会用乐观的态度不断改变自身的愚昧。\n\n心态决定着幸福，好的心态一生都会幸福。\n\n对于好的、能使自己开心和快乐的东西，不要只学会看和聆听，学会去做才会实现你所想要的结果。\n\n相信自己，相信身边的人，相信只要努力梦想就能实现！\n\n于东来\n\n2009年5月3日", "images": {}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//ed2e2d06-cdfe-4cd9-a88a-66556cb605b1/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T09%3A37%3A45Z%2F-1%2F%2F9e96a74cbc7f7d7ba23d1b11dbe04be6941b652cd7e356599fba406033b05c7b"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//ed2e2d06-cdfe-4cd9-a88a-66556cb605b1/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T09%3A37%3A45Z%2F-1%2F%2F0486a445647998339f8f1610be1dbf5034fdb8ad52b0f1f4f4e0105b39db8a83"}], "dataInfo": {"numPages": 1, "pages": [{"width": 2800, "height": 2000}], "type": "pdf"}, "preprocessedImages": ["https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//ed2e2d06-cdfe-4cd9-a88a-66556cb605b1/preprocessed_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T09%3A37%3A45Z%2F-1%2F%2Ffa8be12915971ecb6da1e4bd30465bdc6009bc51f5e5ea625cda6e82b72c2f5f"]}, "errorCode": 0, "errorMsg": "Success"}
